{ White to move and win the rook. }
1. d6+ { [%cal Gd5d6] [%cal Ra5h5] The pawn moves forward with check, and now the rook on a5 attacks the rook on h5. This is a discovered attack. }
1... Ke6 { Black has to get out of check first. }
2. Rxh5 { White wins the rook. }
